ey, with act transitions, the Ancient's boons, and deeper difficulty the further you forge. All five classes — the Warrior, the Plague Doctor, the Sorceress, the Warlock,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T19:02:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951314493","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4874970-1840944183782672","game_id":"steam-4874970","kind":"announcement","title":"The Daily Forge is Lit — One Seed, One Class, One Ladder","summary":"The Daily Forge is lit. Every day at midnight UTC, the Forge deals the whole community one hand: the same seed, the same map, the same class. No lucky maps, no dodging elites your rival had to fight. Whoever forges the sharpest deck from identical parts tops the board. 🔥 How it works One seed for everyone — the daily run is identical for every player: same route options, same shops, same boss waiting at the end. Class of the day — the Forge picks your class. Today a plague doctor, tomorrow maybe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T18:35:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183782672","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4874970-1840310314341779","game_id":"steam-4874970","kind":"announcement","title":"Deck Forge Now Has Online Co-op — And It's In The Free Demo","summary":"The forge runs co-op. The biggest update in Deck Forge's history is live — and every bit of it is in the free demo, right now. ⚔ Real online co-op, zero friction Quick Match — one click finds you a party. No friend codes, no Discord links, no lobbies to babysit. Runs launch the moment two forgers meet, and grow up to four. Drop-in, drop-out — join a run already in 